    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d0c7a5182b0930f2fe93c7224c11c46f.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d0c7a5182b0930f2fe93c7224c11c46f.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d0c7a5182b0930f2fe93c7224c11c46f.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Void Titans are rogue, terraforming machines, determined to replicate and destroy, consuming everything in their path. Void Titans convert the land into base matter and energy, allowing them to teleport across The Void, and replicate themselves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d811e038e07432594c2e10c1fb236d4a.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d811e038e07432594c2e10c1fb236d4a.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d811e038e07432594c2e10c1fb236d4a.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>To combat this threat, a group formed, called the Void Watch. This group trains elite soldiers and equips them with the tech needed to gather all types of matter and convert it into helpful devices, including devices strong enough to kill Void Titans.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/6768fc81a0a655ce4132782c5eacef2e.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/6768fc81a0a655ce4132782c5eacef2e.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/6768fc81a0a655ce4132782c5eacef2e.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play as Jarek Varon, one of these elite soldiers, and embark on missions to delay a Void Titan, kill a Void Titan, or clear civilians from a Void Titan's path. With each successful mission you will earn personal matter to spend on new device blueprints that can unlock new strategies. As your skills progress, uncover the origin of the Void Titans and learn how they can be stopped forever.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/83092985200aa729ad4eb84a863bbe22.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/83092985200aa729ad4eb84a863bbe22.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/83092985200aa729ad4eb84a863bbe22.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Between missions, you can also spend your earnings on customizing and upgrading your home space in order to show off your scores and personality in your new home.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Procedural terrain generation.<br>    </li><li>Compelling story to discover.<br>    </li><li>4+ challenging game modes found throughout the story.<br>    </li><li>Unlockable upgrades and devices.<br>    </li><li>Menu customization for optimal crafting and speed.<br>    </li><li>Base building and decorating.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d0c7a5182b0930f2fe93c7224c11c46f.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d0c7a5182b0930f2fe93c7224c11c46f.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d0c7a5182b0930f2fe93c7224c11c46f.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Void Titans are rogue, terraforming machines, determined to replicate and destroy, consuming everything in their path. Void Titans convert the land into base matter and energy, allowing them to teleport across The Void, and replicate themselves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d811e038e07432594c2e10c1fb236d4a.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d811e038e07432594c2e10c1fb236d4a.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/d811e038e07432594c2e10c1fb236d4a.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>To combat this threat, a group formed, called the Void Watch. This group trains elite soldiers and equips them with the tech needed to gather all types of matter and convert it into helpful devices, including devices strong enough to kill Void Titans.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/6768fc81a0a655ce4132782c5eacef2e.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/6768fc81a0a655ce4132782c5eacef2e.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/6768fc81a0a655ce4132782c5eacef2e.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Play as Jarek Varon, one of these elite soldiers, and embark on missions to delay a Void Titan, kill a Void Titan, or clear civilians from a Void Titan's path. With each successful mission you will earn personal matter to spend on new device blueprints that can unlock new strategies. As your skills progress, uncover the origin of the Void Titans and learn how they can be stopped forever.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/83092985200aa729ad4eb84a863bbe22.poster.avif?t=1668003685\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/83092985200aa729ad4eb84a863bbe22.webm?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2076500/extras/83092985200aa729ad4eb84a863bbe22.mp4?t=1668003685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Between missions, you can also spend your earnings on customizing and upgrading your home space in order to show off your scores and personality in your new home.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">    <li>Procedural terrain generation.<br>    </li><li>Compelling story to discover.<br>    </li><li>4+ challenging game modes found throughout the story.<br>    </li><li>Unlockable upgrades and devices.<br>    </li><li>Menu customization for optimal crafting and speed.<br>    </li><li>Base building and decorating.</li></ul>",
